      }
    },
    "Screen Recording is required. The rest are optional, and you can change any of them later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕录制为必需权限，其余均为可选，之后都可以随时更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Recording is required. Turn on the rest as you need them; you can change any of them later in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕录制是必需的，其余可按需开启，之后也能在设置里修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots are converted before uploading; the copy in your Library stays lossless. 1x makes files about four times smaller but looks softer on Retina displays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "截图会在上传前转换格式，资料库中的副本仍保持无损。缩放为 1x 可让文件缩小约四倍，但在 Retina 屏幕上会略显模糊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots upload exactly as stored in your Library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "截图将按资料库中保存的原样上传。"
