    "Agents such as Claude Code connect over MCP to cut, speed up, zoom, caption and export your recordings. Their edits are saved right away and can be undone in Studio; the original footage is never changed. Only apps running under your account on this Mac can connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Code 等智能体可通过 MCP 连接，对你的录制进行剪辑、变速、缩放、添加字幕和导出。它们的编辑会立即存储，并可在 Studio 中撤销；原始录像不会被改动。只有这台 Mac 上以你的账户运行的 App 才能连接。"
